<p>To answer this question, we need to consider the two choices that can be=
 made at this last house: do we skip it or rob it?</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>If we <strong>skip</strong> it, we end our burglary with the total amoun=
t stolen up to the house at <code>i - 1</code>:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
