jiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
</li>
<li>
<p>If we <strong>rob</strong> it, we couldn't have robbed the previous hous=
e at <code>i - 1</code>, so we end the burglary with the money stolen from =
this final house, plus the total amount stolen up to the house at <code>i -=
